direction: down
title: "C23 GetCache Ready publication and detached diagnostics"
"Runtime services qualified" -> "Reserve Constructing ticket": "global init/bootstrap TLS is an external prerequisite"
"Reserve Constructing ticket" -> "Private allocation and owner": "nested call sees Pending; never waits behind own builder"
"Private allocation and owner" -> "TLS Preparing binding": "known install only; unknown retains builder record"
"TLS Preparing binding" -> "Preparing registry entry": "neither alias serves raw cache before canonical Ready"
"Preparing registry entry" -> "Ready commit": "single release publication after full init, exact epoch and lifetime root"
"Ready commit" -> "Ready read / pin": "acquire matching epoch; check+pin serialized with close"
"Ready read / pin" -> "Owner snapshot ACK": "registry lock released; independent race-free stats copy"
"Owner snapshot ACK" -> "Unpin then format": "format copied values even if cache has retired"
"Unknown publication" -> "Stable builder owner": "query same operation; committed and absent are distinct physical histories"
"Known rejected publication" -> "Private rollback": "detach list/TLS/fast aliases first; unknown free cannot replay"
"Ready commit" -> "Closing and pin drain": "no new fast/diagnostic reads; builder outcome still settles"
"Closing and pin drain" -> "Native cleanup / retire": "clear owner aliases; exact outcome before final cache release"
